subproblems.statement:
Let P, d ∈ ℕ, U ⊆ ℝ^P open, N an embedded C² d-dimensional submanifold of ℝ^P (IsEmbeddedSubmanifold 2 d N), and y₀ ∈ N ∩ U. Then there are r > 0, β ≥ 0 and a map Pt : ℝ^P → L(ℝ^P, ℝ^P) with the following properties:
- B̄_{3r}(y₀) ⊆ U;
- Pt is C¹ on B_{3r}(y₀);
- Pt(y) is self-adjoint, ⟨Pt(y)u, w⟩ = ⟨u, Pt(y)w⟩, for every y ∈ B_{3r}(y₀);
- ‖DPt(y)‖ ≤ β for every y ∈ B_{2r}(y₀);
- for every q ∈ N ∩ B_{3r}(y₀), Pt(q)u ∈ T_qN for all u ∈ ℝ^P, and Pt(q)u = u for all u ∈ T_qN, where T_qN = tangentSpace N q.
In particular, Pt(q) is the orthogonal projection onto T_qN for q ∈ N ∩ B_{3r}(y₀).

Let P, n ∈ ℕ, U, N ⊆ ℝ^P, R = (M, θ, ξ) an IMRep U n, y₀ ∈ ℝ^P, r, β ∈ ℝ with β ≥ 0 and B_{3r}(y₀) ⊆ U, and Pt : ℝ^P → L(ℝ^P, ℝ^P). Assume:
- Pt is C¹ on B_{3r}(y₀), and Pt(y) is self-adjoint for y ∈ B_{3r}(y₀);
- ‖DPt(y)‖ ≤ β for y ∈ B_{2r}(y₀);
- for q ∈ N ∩ B_{3r}(y₀), Pt(q) maps ℝ^P into T_qN = tangentSpace N q and fixes T_qN pointwise;
- μ_R-a.e. x lies in N;
- for μ_R-a.e. x ∈ B_{3r}(y₀), approxTangentPlane n M x ⊆ T_xN;
- x ↦ p_x (orthogonal projection onto approxTangentPlane n M x) is μ_R-AEMeasurable;
- V = v(M, θ) is stationary in U ∩ N (R.IsStationaryAlong N).
Then there is a μ_R-a.e. strongly measurable H : ℝ^P → ℝ^P with |H(x)| ≤ nβ for all x and δV(X) = −∫⟨X, H⟩ dμ_R for every C¹ vector field X with compact support contained in B_{2r}(y₀).

Let P, n ∈ ℕ, U ⊆ ℝ^P, R = (M, θ, ξ) an IMRep U n, z ∈ ℝ^P, r, κ ∈ ℝ with B̄_r(z) ⊆ U, and H : ℝ^P → ℝ^P. Assume:
- x ↦ p_x, the orthogonal projection onto approxTangentPlane n M x, is μ_R-AEMeasurable;
- H is μ_R-a.e. strongly measurable, with |H(x)| ≤ κ for all x;
- δV(X) = −∫⟨X, H⟩ dμ_R (R.firstVariation) for every C¹ vector field X with compact support contained in B_r(z).
Then e^{κσ}σ^{−n}μ_R(B_σ(z)) ≤ e^{κρ}ρ^{−n}μ_R(B_ρ(z)) in [0, ∞] for all 0 < σ ≤ ρ ≤ r (open balls, written with ENNReal.ofReal(e^{κs}/s^n)).
